# Director's Loan Balance — period / quarter / FY (learned)

## Invariant

For any Biz Intel (or sister) date window `[start, end]`:

\[
\text{DL}_{end} = f(\text{txs in window},\ \text{opening at start},\ \text{prior plug})
\]

where **opening at start** = Settings opening rolled forward through **all ledger txs strictly before `start`** (not the Settings figure alone, and not “first month of range if unlocked → Settings”).

Positive balance ⇒ Company owes Director.

## Why Biz Intel looked wrong (class of bugs)

| Bug | Effect on quarter / FY |
|-----|-------------------------|
| **`fundedByDirector` cash missing from `calculateBusinessMetrics`** | Dec airfare / Stamp-zone cash never increase DL → FY/quarter understated (Period tests expect +cash) |
| **Unlocked months all get Settings opening** (`syncAllOpenPeriods`) | April opening ignores Dec advances; Q4 / single month wrong |
| **`metricsOpeningDirectorLoan` = Settings unless that month is locked** | Multi-month FY uses Settings + in-window txs only — drops pre-window DL movement when viewing a quarter |
| **Auto-match prior = full reimbursements** while funded cash is already in the same window | Double-count (see `accounting-directors-loan-fy-double-count.mdc`) → FY ~$10,281 instead of ~$1,500 |
| **localStorage keys stored as literal `"PRIOR_…_STORAGE_KEY"`** | Settings prior/auto-match never persist to the real keys |

## Correct openings (examples)

Settings opening $1,000; Dec director cash $1,516.08; Apr loan +$500; Jun reimburse −$8,781.89.

| View | Opening used | In-window movement | Closing |
|------|----------------|--------------------|---------|
| FY (Jul–Jun) | $1,000 (pre-FY empty) | +1516.08 +500 −8781.89 | **−5765.81** (Director owes) or with full SELPIC mix ~ remaining bank loan |
| Q4 Apr–Jun | **$1,000 + 1516.08** (roll Dec) | +500 −8781.89 | same chain continuity |
| Dec only | $1,000 | +1516.08 | **2516.08** Company owes |

Period Management monthly chain and Biz Intel range balance must agree on the same `f`.

## SSOT formula

`calculateBusinessMetrics` / `calculateBusinessMetrics`:

`Opening + Prior plug + bank DL credits − bank DL debits/withdrawals + director-funded cash debits − reimbursements ± personal`

Auto-match prior plug:

`max(0, reimbursements − director-funded cash in the same window)`  
(or **0** when opening was already roll-forwarded from full history before the window).

## Sister surfaces

Biz Intel cards · **Reports → Director's Loan Ledger (BAS)** · Period Management · Balance Sheet / TB · ATO lodgment metrics opening.

Reports bug (confirmed): Q4 opening already rolled Dec cash (~$9,781.89) then auto prior +$8,781.89 again → opening $18,563.78 and closing **$10,281.89**. Fix: `resolvePriorAdvancesForScopedWindow(..., hasHistoryBeforeWindow=true)` → prior 0; closing ~$1,500.

## Do not

- Show Settings opening as the period opening on a mid-FY quarter
- OCR-collapse or omit Cash Expense `fundedByDirector` rows when computing DL
- Dump auto-match prior into a single Period month
- Paste Biz Intel cash P&L Net into CTR (separate GST-basis rule)
